    ]
   },
   {
    "claim": "The policy caused only some of the failures at that setting. In two runs the planned path bent left on a STRAIGHT command and the ego hit the car passing alongside, so the left drift is still there at 2 Hz. In the third run that car cut in from behind on the left and hit the ego, which was not the policy's fault. Without that run the policy-caused failures alone would probably not clear the bar.",
    "settings": [
