   },
   {
    "claim": "On the same scene, cars 1.5 s earlier at 2.0x speed failed in its only run: the ego stayed a lane left of its route and did not brake for a slower car ahead. The run was flagged as a possible simulator artifact, but triage found the car clearly visible, so rendering does not explain it. A single run is a hint, not a rate.",
    "settings": [
     "S13"
